      ":question/id": "03aea055-8649-5699-a362-800641639098",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true, given that $A$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix and $det(A)=1$?\n\nI. $A\\text{ is not invertible}$\n\nII. $\\text{rank}(A)=3$\n\nIII. $A\\text{ does not have }3\\text{ pivot columns}$",
